---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../styles/sellers.css";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Sell Your Home in DuPage County | AJ Tayfel"
  description="Home selling guidance for DuPage County and Chicago's western suburbs with AJ Tayfel, REALTOR®."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">For Sellers</p>

      <h1>
        Selling well starts<br />
        before the sign goes up.
      </h1>

      <p class="lede">
        Preparation, positioning, timing, and presentation can shape the
        outcome long before the first showing.
      </p>

      <a class="button-premium" href="/contact/">
        Discuss My Home
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="strategy">
    <div class="container strategy-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Seller Strategy</p>
        <h2>Build the plan around the next move.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="strategy-copy">
        <p>
          A listing decision rarely exists by itself. You may be buying
          locally, relocating, downsizing, moving closer to family, or simply
          trying to maximize flexibility.
        </p>

        <p>
          The right selling strategy should account for what happens after the
          home sells, not just what happens on launch day.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="process">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">The Selling Process</p>
      <h2>Prepare deliberately. Launch confidently.</h2>

      <div class="steps">
        <article>
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>Assess the property</h3>
          <p>
            Review condition, likely buyer expectations, preparation needs,
            and items that may affect marketability.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>02</span>
          <h3>Position the listing</h3>
          <p>
            Use comparable sales, active competition, condition, and timing to
            establish a defensible market strategy.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>03</span>
          <h3>Present the home</h3>
          <p>
            Focus effort where presentation can improve clarity, confidence,
            and the buyer's first impression.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>04</span>
          <h3>Manage the transaction</h3>
          <p>
            Evaluate offers beyond price and keep attorney review, inspection,
            appraisal, financing, and closing milestones coordinated.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relocation">
    <div class="container relocation-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Moving Out of Illinois?</p>
        <h2>Your sale may be only half of the move.</h2>

        <p>
          If the next home is in another state, the Illinois listing and
          destination purchase should be planned together.
        </p>

        <a class="text-link" href="/relocation/">
          Explore Relocation Services →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="relocation-index">
        <a href="/relocation/chicago-to-southwest-florida/">
          <span>Featured</span>
          <strong>Chicago → Southwest Florida</strong>
          <b>↗</b>
        </a>

        <a href="/relocation/selling-illinois-home-before-moving-to-florida/">
          <span>Guide</span>
          <strong>Selling Before Moving to Florida</strong>
          <b>↗</b>
        </a>

        <a href="/relocation/should-you-sell-illinois-house-before-buying-in-florida/">
          <span>Guide</span>
          <strong>Sell First or Buy First?</strong>
          <b>↗</b>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="closing">
    <div class="container closing-inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Thinking About Selling?</p>
        <h2>Start with the property and your timing.</h2>
      </div>

      <a class="button-premium light" href="/contact/">
        Contact AJ
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
